      "widgets_values": [
        "OmniCam -> Wan / ATI / LTX tracks (screen_tracks)\n\nAuthor motion layers in the Director's Motion Tracks panel, then queue.\n\nConnect Monitor.tracks_json to the tracks input of:\n  wanvideo_ati       -> WanVideoATITracks.tracks\n  wan_track_native   -> WanTrackToVideo.tracks\n  ltx25_motion_track -> LTXVDrawTracks.tracks\n\nFor wan_move_native use Monitor.native_tracks instead: that profile\nemits the TRACKS tensors WanMoveTrackToVideo.tracks expects.\n\nWatch the 'Encodable trajectories' preflight check. A layer hidden on\nthe first sample cannot be represented in these JSON formats and is\ndropped; one that disappears and returns is cut at the gap."
      ],
